# S18b, member a (k10): with b to the west end of stag0101; waits near matz02 without pressing anything while b's prompt
# is open, then b leaves the room: b's prompt closes by itself (SEAMLESS.md 6.5), b's player goes, and a's own prompt
# takes it to stag0102. (Before, the prompt read a's pad, which a never pressed: present stayed 3, a got no prompt.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@90
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west:-258,-194}
wander -262 -191 5 until asking>=1,frames>=120 fail stagechange
log b holds its prompt
wander -262 -191 5 until present=1 fail frames>=1800,stagechange
log b's prompt closed, b is gone
mat matz02 yes until stage=stag0102,control fail frames>=2400
log a left by matz02
wander 330 140 12 until frames>=300
idle until frames>=60
